{"labs": [{"id": 0, "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "id": 0, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "_data": []}, {"type": "audio", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn4le18ob08re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn4le18ob08re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "", "time": ""}, {"image": "engenn4le18ob08re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Amanda, I have a bit of a problem. I need some suggestions.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Amanda</span>: What's wrong?<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Well ... my sister is getting married this weekend.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Amanda</span>: That's great! <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: The wedding is in Utah, and I just realized there are no flights on Saturday morning.", "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn4le18ob08re2img05.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Amanda</span>: Oh dear. Does that mean that you have to leave on Friday and miss work? We have our weekly meeting, and the market analysis for Monster Jam is due.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I know. I sent an e-mail to Mr. Warren.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Amanda</span>: You could tell him that you finished your work.  I can have your folders on the Outreach Program.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: That's true. Thanks!", "time": "20000"}, {"image": "engenn4le18ob08re2img05.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Amanda</span>: What about sounding shocked and surprised in the e-mail? It might help.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yeah, I might also suggest that I can work overtime on Monday as well.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Amanda</span>: Good idea and good luck!", "time": "43000"}], "audiosrc": "engenn4le18ob08re2aud01"}}], "title": "", "template_override": 1, "id": 1, "_data": []}, {"type": "video", "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn4le18ob08re3vid01", "images": [{"image":